 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535338 true] [17592186344408 1111 #uuid "eb6eb67f-7548-5252-99cc-de0dcaaee9b6" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344409 1017 #edb/ref 17592186344410 13194139535338 true] [17592186344409 1089 "q-127497" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344409 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535338 true] [17592186344409 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062909/assets/a3ca092dc7c0668ac465d4832b91a2b831af057ff22e357b4e7105bfb454ea18.png)\n\nFind $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for the circle shown above." 13194139535338 true] [17592186344409 1113 #uuid "5d6ad7e4-7acd-5527-83e9-b8c007bd5d06" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344409 1145 "Since our circle is centered at $(1,0)$ and has a radius of $2,$ its equation is given by\n\n$$\n(x-1)^{2}+(y-0)^{2}={2}^{2}\\,⟹\\,(x-1)^{2}+{y}^{2}=4.\n$$\n\nNow, to calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x},$ we use implicit differentiation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}((x-1)^{2}+{y}^{2}) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}((x-1)^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({y}^{2}) & =0 \\\\ 2(x-1)+2y\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =0 \\\\ 2y\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-2(x-1) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1-x}{y}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344410 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344411 13194139535338 true] [17592186344410 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344412 13194139535338 true] [17592186344410 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344413 13194139535338 true] [17592186344410 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344414 13194139535338 true] [17592186344410 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344415 13194139535338 true] [17592186344410 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535338 true] [17592186344410 1041 "selection" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344410 1104 #edb/ref 17592186344414 13194139535338 true] [17592186344410 1110 #uuid "eeea34fc-8fe7-598f-b1a6-465bcec53034" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344411 1034 "(1-x)y" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344411 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535338 true] [17592186344411 1111 #uuid "47097999-98b6-5670-8195-340436682d72" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344412 1034 "-(x+1)y" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344412 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535338 true] [17592186344412 1111 #uuid "e98a27c2-fe1a-5c99-8192-a42813ca62c2" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344413 1034 "-\\frac{x+1}{y}" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344413 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535338 true] [17592186344413 1111 #uuid "f68d9db6-a081-523e-abc1-8a38c58b966a" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344414 1034 "\\frac{1-x}{y}" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344414 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535338 true] [17592186344414 1111 #uuid "d01b4e02-8bc2-50f5-8a2f-d8ba9f925df3" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344415 1034 "\\frac{x+1}{y}" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344415 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535338 true] [17592186344415 1111 #uuid "47205664-36e4-5beb-85c8-6dc57fbad80c" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344416 1017 #edb/ref 17592186344417 13194139535338 true] [17592186344416 1089 "q-127499" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344416 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535338 true] [17592186344416 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062909/assets/2f08e0a0d1fd855f2d179ac65dbdf5d022f3488b85c78b5cbb507f12bd69487e.png)\n\nFind $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for the circle shown above." 13194139535338 true] [17592186344416 1113 #uuid "8addafb3-53aa-51de-9e83-4de2a2f51ef5" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344416 1145 "Since our circle is centered at $(-1,1)$ and has a radius of $1,$ its equation is given by\n\n$$\n(x-(-1))^{2}+(y-1)^{2}={1}^{2}\\,⟹\\,(x+1)^{2}+(y-1)^{2}=1.\n$$\n\nNow, to calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x},$ we use implicit differentiation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}((x+1)^{2}+(y-1)^{2}) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(1) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}((x+1)^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}((y-1)^{2}) & =0 \\\\ 2(x+1)+2(y-1)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =0 \\\\ 2(y-1)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-2(x+1) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-\\frac{x+1}{y-1} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{x+1}{1-y}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344417 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344418 13194139535338 true] [17592186344417 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344419 13194139535338 true] [17592186344417 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344420 13194139535338 true] [17592186344417 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344421 13194139535338 true] [17592186344417 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344422 13194139535338 true] [17592186344417 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535338 true] [17592186344417 1041 "selection" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344417 1104 #edb/ref 17592186344420 13194139535338 true] [17592186344417 1110 #uuid "86d9054f-01f4-5cdb-a841-f3ee6daaf735" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344418 1034 "\\frac{2(x+1)}{y-1}" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344418 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535338 true] [17592186344418 1111 #uuid "ffbfdf84-89ac-501d-9d0e-a8247119c053" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344419 1034 "\\frac{1-x}{y+1}" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344419 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535338 true] [17592186344419 1111 #uuid "c950d74c-c1ed-5acd-b68d-2fc1b6c46651" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344420 1034 "\\frac{x+1}{1-y}" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344420 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535338 true] [17592186344420 1111 #uuid "90dd0c2b-eda3-55eb-83ec-8fdf22adb1cc" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344421 1034 "2(x+1)(y+1)" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344421 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535338 true] [17592186344421 1111 #uuid "6b029d17-737c-570e-bcdd-c02a1295a428" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344422 1034 "(x+1)(1-y)" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344422 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535338 true] [17592186344422 1111 #uuid "6ce1ddc8-bd80-565b-afac-6b778dff1842" 13194139535338 true] [17592186344423 1017 #edb/ref 17592186344424 13194139535338 tr